108
00:07:34,920 --> 00:07:38,520
The confinement and energy intensity of that light is just so high,

109
00:07:38,620 --> 00:07:41,160
and it forces the oscillations into such a small volume

110
00:07:41,160 --> 00:07:44,200
that the electric field in silicon no longer responds linearly,

111
00:07:44,720 --> 00:07:48,140
known as a third-order chi-cubed nonlinear optical response.

112
00:07:48,260 --> 00:07:53,340
This is important, though, because it can spontaneously cause the energy of two photons from the laser

113
00:07:53,340 --> 00:07:57,100
